5238 0 obj
<</K[ 5237 0 R ]/P 5233 0 R /S/LBody>>
endobj
5239 0 obj
<</ActualText(Servers are generally located in machine rooms where power and cooling can be managed more )/K[ 10]/P 5240 0 R /Pg 60 0 R /S/Span>>
endobj
