<</K[ 5240 0 R ]/P 5211 0 R /S/Textbox>>
endobj
5242 0 obj
<</ActualText(effectively. Remote management permits servers to be located anywhere. It is less expensive to rent )/K[ 11]/P 5240 0 R /Pg 60 0 R /S/Span>>
endobj
5243 0 obj
<</ActualText(colocation space elsewhere than to build a computer room in your office. It is often also more reliable.)/K[ 12]/P 5240 0 R /Pg 60 0 R /S/Span>>
endobj
5244 0 obj
<</ActualText(Services that are replicated in many places must be manageable in a centralized fashion. Remote )/K[ 13]/P 5245 0 R /Pg 60 0 R /S/Span>>
